{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952440/extras/40884aecfef55f024e8171fc12edd579.avif?t=1755752035\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cardamom is a visual novel set in a Broadway musical. Play as a cartoon cat and befriend the cat loving residents of the building. Make decisions and listening to your outcome in song.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your mouse to make choices and navigate the map.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the key board to &quot;exit&quot; or &quot;return&quot; to pull up the pause menu.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Demo Version:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains chapter 1 and 1 song from the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will  make one character choice, be tutorialized how to use the mailroom, and choose a bed partner (scandalous).<br>After the chapter you will receive an achievement for completing the demo.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Full Length Version:</strong><br>The full length game contains 8 different endings, 7 chapters, and 17 different songs.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to wishlist the full game, if you liked what you played!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952440/extras/40884aecfef55f024e8171fc12edd579.avif?t=1755752035\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Discarded in box","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3952440/123e86662f956845eeb255c8c494cd7b2ccd7cdb.jpg"},{"name":"Gave bill to V